": "Float"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["二次放大，二次放大作用主要是放大图片同时锐化图像。参数说明由左到右：\n1.lora强度（强度越高画面越锐利，分块后颜色不一致问题越小，推进最低数值0.35，甜点区0.4不建议开太高）\n\n2.图片大小，默认8指的是800万像素，即长乘宽之后值。我这个放大不设置图片边长是考虑到极端比例，遇到极端比例了设置长边和短板都不合适，所以设置像素总量。这个值最大可以开到16，也就是1600万像素，约等于4096*4096\n\n3.分块大小，默认240指的是240万像素，也就是分块时候每个分块大约240万像素。这个值一般不建议动。除非是放大后色块不一致和无中生有特别严重可以调大。根据我得测试，最佳值是100-420之间。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [818.5861206054688, 145.0746307373047], "pos": [14599.9677734375, 147.2820587158203], "id": 112, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [166], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [395.7022399902344, 130.13522338867188], "pos": [15584.53125, 966.5491333007812], "widgets_values": ["t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors", "clip-vit-large-patch14/model.safetensors", "flux", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name1"}, "name": "clip_name1", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP1"}, {"widget": {"name": "clip_name2"}, "name": "clip_name2", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP2"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 116, "type": "DualCLIPLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DualCLIPLoader"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [771.2552490234375, 668.352783203125], "pos": [15524.005859375, 520.1137084960938], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 85, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}